{"total": 47.564, "lines": [{"cap": "There's a town in Alaska where almost everyone lives in the same building.", "start": 0.36, "end": 4.014, "audio_at": 0.3, "dur": 3.893875, "words": [{"text": "There's", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.48}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.492, "end": 0.54}, {"text": "town", "start": 0.552, "end": 0.889}, {"text": "in", "start": 0.901, "end": 0.961}, {"text": "Alaska", "start": 0.973, "end": 1.55}, {"text": "where", "start": 1.562, "end": 1.754}, {"text": "almost", "start": 1.766, "end": 2.175}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 2.295, "end": 2.74}, {"text": "lives", "start": 2.752, "end": 3.148}, {"text": "in", "start": 3.16, "end": 3.281}, {"text": "the", "start": 3.293, "end": 3.365}, {"text": "same", "start": 3.377, "end": 3.641}, {"text": "building", "start": 3.653, "end": 4.014}]}, {"cap": "One building. Fourteen floors.", "start": 4.634, "end": 6.413, "audio_at": 4.574, "dur": 2.018833, "words": [{"text": "One", "start": 4.634, "end": 4.802}, {"text": "building", "start": 4.814, "end": 5.151}, {"text": "Fourteen", "start": 5.595, "end": 5.908}, {"text": "floors", "start": 5.92, "end": 6.413}]}, {"cap": "It's called Whittier, and only around two hundred and seventy people live there.", "start": 7.033, "end": 10.47, "audio_at": 6.973, "dur": 3.6775, "words": [{"text": "It's", "start": 7.033, "end": 7.129}, {"text": "called", "start": 7.141, "end": 7.417}, {"text": "Whittier", "start": 7.429, "end": 7.838}, {"text": "and", "start": 8.042, "end": 8.162}, {"text": "only", "start": 8.175, "end": 8.415}, {"text": "around", "start": 8.427, "end": 8.751}, {"text": "two", "start": 8.763, "end": 8.98}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 8.992, "end": 9.232}, {"text": "and", "start": 9.244, "end": 9.304}, {"text": "seventy", "start": 9.316, "end": 9.665}, {"text": "people", "start": 9.677, "end": 9.977}, {"text": "live", "start": 9.989, "end": 10.182}, {"text": "there", "start": 10.194, "end": 10.47}]}, {"cap": "Inside the tower, there's the police station, the post office, a clinic, a little grocery store… and a church.", "start": 11.09, "end": 17.328, "audio_at": 11.03, "dur": 6.477958, "words": [{"text": "Inside", "start": 11.09, "end": 11.475}, {"text": "the", "start": 11.487, "end": 11.559}, {"text": "tower", "start": 11.571, "end": 12.016}, {"text": "there's", "start": 12.268, "end": 12.436}, {"text": "the", "start": 12.448, "end": 12.533}, {"text": "police", "start": 12.545, "end": 12.881}, {"text": "station", "start": 12.893, "end": 13.362}, {"text": "the", "start": 13.602, "end": 13.674}, {"text": "post", "start": 13.686, "end": 13.987}, {"text": "office", "start": 13.999, "end": 14.432}, {"text": "a", "start": 14.624, "end": 14.66}, {"text": "clinic", "start": 14.672, "end": 15.117}, {"text": "a", "start": 15.357, "end": 15.393}, {"text": "little", "start": 15.405, "end": 15.633}, {"text": "grocery", "start": 15.646, "end": 16.03}, {"text": "store", "start": 16.042, "end": 16.427}, {"text": "and", "start": 16.691, "end": 16.763}, {"text": "a", "start": 16.775, "end": 16.811}, {"text": "church", "start": 16.823, "end": 17.328}]}, {"cap": "The kids don't even go outside to get to school. There's a tunnel straight to it.", "start": 17.948, "end": 21.542, "audio_at": 17.888, "dur": 3.83375, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 17.948, "end": 18.008}, {"text": "kids", "start": 18.02, "end": 18.297}, {"text": "don't", "start": 18.309, "end": 18.501}, {"text": "even", "start": 18.513, "end": 18.681}, {"text": "go", "start": 18.693, "end": 18.898}, {"text": "outside", "start": 18.91, "end": 19.366}, {"text": "to", "start": 19.378, "end": 19.439}, {"text": "get", "start": 19.451, "end": 19.595}, {"text": "to", "start": 19.607, "end": 19.667}, {"text": "school", "start": 19.679, "end": 20.052}, {"text": "There's", "start": 20.46, "end": 20.568}, {"text": "a", "start": 20.58, "end": 20.628}, {"text": "tunnel", "start": 20.64, "end": 20.893}, {"text": "straight", "start": 20.905, "end": 21.193}, {"text": "to", "start": 21.205, "end": 21.374}, {"text": "it", "start": 21.386, "end": 21.542}]}, {"cap": "Why? The tower was built for the army in the 1950s, and winters here are brutal: snow, wind and storms.", "start": 22.262, "end": 29.594, "audio_at": 22.202, "dur": 7.571709, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 22.262, "end": 22.526}, {"text": "The", "start": 22.935, "end": 22.995}, {"text": "tower", "start": 23.007, "end": 23.332}, {"text": "was", "start": 23.344, "end": 23.5}, {"text": "built", "start": 23.512, "end": 23.74}, {"text": "for", "start": 23.752, "end": 23.872}, {"text": "the", "start": 23.884, "end": 23.981}, {"text": "army", "start": 23.993, "end": 24.341}, {"text": "in", "start": 24.353, "end": 24.413}, {"text": "the", "start": 24.425, "end": 24.485}, {"text": "1950s", "start": 24.497, "end": 25.495}, {"text": "and", "start": 25.723, "end": 25.868}, {"text": "winters", "start": 25.88, "end": 26.252}, {"text": "here", "start": 26.264, "end": 26.553}, {"text": "are", "start": 26.661, "end": 26.769}, {"text": "brutal", "start": 26.781, "end": 27.202}, {"text": "snow", "start": 27.586, "end": 28.031}, {"text": "wind", "start": 28.404, "end": 28.728}, {"text": "and", "start": 28.872, "end": 28.957}, {"text": "storms", "start": 28.969, "end": 29.594}]}, {"cap": "And the only road into town goes through a one-lane tunnel… shared with a train.", "start": 30.214, "end": 34.288, "audio_at": 30.154, "dur": 4.3145, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 30.214, "end": 30.274}, {"text": "the", "start": 30.286, "end": 30.394}, {"text": "only", "start": 30.406, "end": 30.718}, {"text": "road", "start": 30.73, "end": 31.007}, {"text": "into", "start": 31.019, "end": 31.175}, {"text": "town", "start": 31.187, "end": 31.524}, {"text": "goes", "start": 31.536, "end": 31.884}, {"text": "through", "start": 31.896, "end": 32.065}, {"text": "a", "start": 32.077, "end": 32.173}, {"text": "one-lane", "start": 32.185, "end": 32.702}, {"text": "tunnel", "start": 32.714, "end": 33.074}, {"text": "shared", "start": 33.399, "end": 33.711}, {"text": "with", "start": 33.723, "end": 33.843}, {"text": "a", "start": 33.855, "end": 33.88}, {"text": "train", "start": 33.892, "end": 34.288}]}, {"cap": "At night, the tunnel closes.", "start": 34.908, "end": 36.507, "audio_at": 34.848, "dur": 1.838541, "words": [{"text": "At", "start": 34.908, "end": 35.028}, {"text": "night", "start": 35.04, "end": 35.353}, {"text": "the", "start": 35.569, "end": 35.653}, {"text": "tunnel", "start": 35.665, "end": 35.93}, {"text": "closes", "start": 35.942, "end": 36.507}]}, {"cap": "Miss the last car, and you're not going home.", "start": 37.127, "end": 39.074, "audio_at": 37.067, "dur": 2.187125, "words": [{"text": "Miss", "start": 37.127, "end": 37.283}, {"text": "the", "start": 37.295, "end": 37.379}, {"text": "last", "start": 37.391, "end": 37.68}, {"text": "car", "start": 37.692, "end": 37.992}, {"text": "and", "start": 38.232, "end": 38.28}, {"text": "you're", "start": 38.292, "end": 38.389}, {"text": "not", "start": 38.401, "end": 38.569}, {"text": "going", "start": 38.581, "end": 38.785}, {"text": "home", "start": 38.797, "end": 39.074}]}, {"cap": "So the whole town lives like neighbors in one giant apartment.", "start": 39.894, "end": 42.875, "audio_at": 39.834, "dur": 3.2207500000000002, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 39.894, "end": 39.99}, {"text": "the", "start": 40.002, "end": 40.086}, {"text": "whole", "start": 40.098, "end": 40.351}, {"text": "town", "start": 40.363, "end": 40.651}, {"text": "lives", "start": 40.663, "end": 40.903}, {"text": "like", "start": 40.915, "end": 41.084}, {"text": "neighbors", "start": 41.096, "end": 41.528}, {"text": "in", "start": 41.6, "end": 41.793}, {"text": "one", "start": 41.805, "end": 42.057}, {"text": "giant", "start": 42.069, "end": 42.346}, {"text": "apartment", "start": 42.358, "end": 42.875}]}, {"cap": "Could you live in a town inside one building? Tell me in the comments.", "start": 43.595, "end": 46.804, "audio_at": 43.535, "dur": 3.449125, "words": [{"text": "Could", "start": 43.595, "end": 43.703}, {"text": "you", "start": 43.715, "end": 43.811}, {"text": "live", "start": 43.823, "end": 44.003}, {"text": "in", "start": 44.015, "end": 44.075}, {"text": "a", "start": 44.087, "end": 44.135}, {"text": "town", "start": 44.147, "end": 44.472}, {"text": "inside", "start": 44.484, "end": 44.893}, {"text": "one", "start": 44.905, "end": 45.073}, {"text": "building", "start": 45.085, "end": 45.445}, {"text": "Tell", "start": 45.842, "end": 45.95}, {"text": "me", "start": 45.962, "end": 46.058}, {"text": "in", "start": 46.07, "end": 46.131}, {"text": "the", "start": 46.143, "end": 46.215}, {"text": "comments", "start": 46.227, "end": 46.804}]}]}